<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="font-family:arial"><font size="2">Ref No:&nbsp;</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>{{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
I was sorry to hear that your baggage was damaged while travelling with us on QF{{{Case.Flight_Number__c}}} on {{{Case.TECH_Email_Arrival_Date_Time__c}}} recently.<br />
<br />
<strong>Our damaged checked baggage policy</strong><br />
<br />
Any damage sustained to checked baggage needs to be reported to Baggage Services staff at the time of collection. When this is done, a report is made to back up any further claims.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
We understand damage isn’t always noticed straight away, so we allow our customers a further {{{Case.Within_3_or_7_days__c}}} days from arrival to report the damage in writing.<br />
<br />
As your report was made outside this period, we’re unfortunately unable to consider your claim.<br />
<br />
If you need further information about our damaged baggage policy, visit <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/travel-info/baggage/baggage-services.html#damaged-checked-baggage">Baggage Services</a>&nbsp;on our website.</p>

<p><strong>We're here to help</strong><br />
<br />
We'd be happy to provide you with all the information you need to make a claim<br />
<br />
<br />
<em>Or<br />
For fraudulent cases use:&nbsp;</em><br />
<br />
<strong>We're rejecting your claim at this time.&nbsp;</strong><br />
<br />
Our investigation found the images you submitted to support your claim were available on the internet and dated prior to your travel. &nbsp;</p>

<p>If you believe this determination to be an error or can provide further supporting evidence, please respond to this email and provide additional evidence, otherwise, this case will be closed in 7 days.<br />
<br />
<em>(For Fraudulent cases - <u>do not</u> include 'We're here to help' information)</em><br />
<br />
Kind regards,</p>
</body>
